0..72 Comment "// What the cumulative hierarchy refuses. A fold through a set\'s picking"
73..146 Comment "// function answers at its motive, so a member returned where its rank is"
147..224 Comment "// expected is refused; the recursion descends only to a member, so a call on"
225..298 Comment "// the set itself is refused; and the sets range over a universe, so they"
299..373 Comment "// cannot live in it. Shared with `../../model/universe/v-infinity.gandr`."
